  <Architecture>
    Tauri 2 desktop application with a Rust backend, Vue 3 renderer, preserved
    Muya WYSIWYG engine, local-first filesystem services, and tag-triggered
    distribution.
  </Architecture>
  <Runtime>
    <phase-A>Node.js 20 LTS (electron-vite build), Electron 30 LTS (app runtime)</phase-A>
    <phase-B>
      Rust 1.75+ (Tauri backend), system WKWebView on macOS / WebView2 on
      Windows / webkit2gtk on Linux
    </phase-B>
  </Runtime>
  <Language>
    <phase-A>JavaScript (existing) + TypeScript (incremental, new modules only)</phase-A>
    <phase-B>
      Rust (backend) + TypeScript (frontend), JavaScript legacy retained only in
      src/muya/
    </phase-B>
  </Language>
